    exampleHands: [
      'Setup example: 4 card(s) per player.',
      'Rule example: Be the first to reach 151 points (or first team in partnership play). If both reach 151 on the same hand, the higher score wins.',
      "Turn-flow example: Each turn, play one card from your hand face up onto the center pile. If your card's rank matches the top card of the pile, you capture the whole pile; playing a Jack also captures the pile regardless of the top card. Otherwise your card stays on the pile. The first capture also takes the four face-down center cards. When everyone has played their four cards, the dealer deals four more to each from the stock; play continues until the stock is exhausted. The last team or player to make a capture takes any remaining cards. Score after each hand; first to 151 wins.",
      'Scoring example: Points for captured cards: Jack 1, Ace 1, 2 of Clubs 2, 10 of Diamonds 3; majority of cards 3; pişti (single-card capture by matching rank) 10; double pişti (Jack on Jack) 20. If both take 26 cards, no majority point. First to 151 wins. First to reach 151 or more points at the end of a hand; if both reach 151 on the same hand, the higher score wins..',
